			"notes": "<img width=\"433\" height=\"144\" alt=\"release-0 0 7\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5362f818-7ef2-48fe-895b-449f8ec2f96c\" />\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ElytraServers/gtm-quality-of-life/compare/0.0.5.1...0.0.7\n\n*0.0.6 is not working well, so the release was removed.*\n\n## Changes\n\n- Added options for every item decorators for customizing what items to decorate. The options accepts a string that can use Brace Expansion, like `{lv,mv,hv}_machine` will be parsed into 3 items for 3 tiers.\n  **But notice that, from this version on, you'll need delete, or if changed, manually update the configuration file to get the up-to-date configuration values.**"
